From: Sebastian Riempp <sebastian.riempp@gmx.de>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:49:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] Mobile: Add pinch zoom and font scale to tile view

Adds notes.tileFontScale (60-160%) and raises notes.tileColumns' maximum
to 5. The "smaller"/"larger" toolbar buttons now follow the earlier
plugin's zoom() steps: column count changes first, and once at either
end of the 1-5 column range, the font scale changes by 10 instead.
NoteTile scales its title, preview text and image height by that factor.

NoteTileList also recognizes a two-finger pinch gesture over the grid
(a View using the responder system directly, capturing only once a
second touch appears so single-finger scrolling in the FlatList is
unaffected) and applies the same zoom steps once the finger distance
changes by more than 60px, matching the plugin's threshold.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0122rnadKkGCFMVkX948oRD8

